      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "王明，你现在方便吗？我想请你帮个忙。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "可以，怎么了？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个文件我看了两次，还是有一部分不明白。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "哪一部分？你指给我看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "就是这里。我不知道为什么要先做这一步。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "因为后面的结果要用到这里的数据。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "哦，所以如果这里错了，后面也会错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对。你可以先检查这三个数字。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "然后再继续，对吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，这样比较安全，也容易找到问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "明白了。我刚才一直从后面找原因。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "所以越看越复杂，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，差点儿把自己看糊涂了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "遇到这种情况，先回到最前面。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个方法我记住了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你先试一下，我五分钟以后再回来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，如果解决了我告诉你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc004_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
